Description: Load, validate, and manipulate Clinical Data Interchange
    Standards Consortium ('CDISC') Analysis Data Model ('ADaM') dataset
    metadata stored as 'YAML' files. Metadata files are validated against
    a JSON schema. Provides functions to inspect and modify columns,
    parameters, and row-level operations within and across 'ADaM' domains.
    Designed for use with the 'mighty' framework.
